ut of sample, but they are five weeks older than the cutoff; the freshness experiment says the short-history assets (SPCX, SP500, XAU, WTIOIL) would gain from a refit through 2026-11-08, which the credit budget did not let me validate. On the starter's window below, 2026-10-08 → 2026-11-07, these parameters are therefore still out of sample.\")\ns = s.replace(\"- **Served parameters\", \"- **Served parameters\")\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"@@\" agent/report.md; tail -3 scratch/runs/champ_24h.log | cut -c1-170; tail -2 scratch/runs/champ_1h.log | cut -c1-170","description":"Write CHAMPION nomination with measured numbers; fill report note","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":388,"cache_read_input_tokens":504462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":388,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5de06de-0f9b-444f-a451-a2a51a4613ad","uuid":"decd0f44-af30-4f79-9ff4-18e5b7c4e5b1","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:19:46.036Z"}
