{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CgwXfNQDX3Vvnt1KZgvmR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NXUE2QSVA24SxHSD5DhmX3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"pkill -f \"[p]ipeline.sh final\"; pkill -f \"[r]esearch/train.py\"; sleep 1\npython3 - << 'EOF'\nimport re, subprocess\ndef rows(path):\n    out = []\n    for line in open(path):\n        t = line.split()\n        if len(t) >= 6 and re.match(r\"^\\d+/\\d+$\", t[5]): out.append((t[0], t[2], t[5]))\n    return out\nr24, r1 = rows(\"/workspace/scratch/runs/champ_24h.log\"), rows(\"/workspace/scratch/runs/champ_1h.log\")\nper24 = \", \".join(f\"{a} {c} ({k})\" for a, c, k in r24); per1 = \", \".join(f\"{a} {c} ({k})\" for a, c, k in r1)\nsha = \"6e3fc56\"\nfull = subprocess.run([\"git\", \"-C\", \"/workspace\", \"rev-parse\", sha], capture_output=True, text=True).stdout.strip()\nchamp = f\"\"\"sha: {full}\nagent_dir: agent\nprofiles: [low, high]\nnotes: |\n  Seasonal, session-aware log-normal stochastic-volatility simulator; every parameter fitted on the\n  validator's CRPS (agent/core.py, agent/modeling.py, agent/params/). CONTEXT_DAYS 30. Stochastic,\n  seeded from SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED. Interface probe: ok (24h + 1h), 0.5 s / 0.1 s per call.\n  Served parameters: profile, event tables and model fitted on data before 2026-10-01, so both windows\n  below are OUT OF SAMPLE for them.\n  Backtested CRPS per configuration, official scorer (agent/predict.py), 1000 paths, validator prompts\n  scored 2026-10-08 -> 2026-11-07, champion exactly as served (asset-coefficient weighted mean CRPS),\n  next to the harness starter (constant-sigma log-normal) on the same prompts:\n    CRYPTO_24H  champion 3663.19  starter 3785.58  (-3.23 %; paired vs best miner -0.02 %, vs median miner -0.26 %)\n    COM_EQU_24H champion 1799.38  starter 1988.95  (-9.53 %; paired vs best miner -0.01 %, vs median miner -0.72 %)\n    CRYPTO_1H   champion  791.12  starter  833.37  (-5.07 %; paired vs best miner -0.06 %, vs median miner -0.33 %)\n  Per asset, CRPS (paired rank among miners): {per24};\n  1h: {per1}.\n  Same parameters on the longer window 2026-10-02 -> 2026-11-07 (quantile matching off):\n  CRYPTO_24H 3535.55, COM_EQU_24H 1696.93, CRYPTO_1H 760.73.\n\"\"\"\nopen(\"/workspace/agent/CHAMPION\", \"w\").write(champ)\np = \"/workspace/agent/report.md\"; s = open(p).read()\nfor k, v in {\"@@C24@@\": \"3663.19\", \"@@D24@@\": \"-3.23 %\", \"@@E24@@\": \"1799.38\", \"@@DE24@@\": \"-9.53 %\", \"@@C1@@\": \"791.12\", \"@@D1@@\": \"-5.07 %\"}.items(): s = s.replace(k, v)\ns = s.replace(\"quantile matching and tick grid on; see section 5 for what is in and out of sample):\", \"quantile matching and tick grid on; out of sample for the served parameters, see section 5). Paired against the field on these prompts: -0.02 % / -0.01 % / -0.06 % vs the best miner per asset and -0.26 % / -0.72 % / -0.33 % vs the median miner:\")\ns += f\"\"\"\n## Appendix — champion per asset (2026-10-08 → 2026-11-07, CRPS and paired rank among miners)\n\n24h: {per24}.\n\n1h: {per1}.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nj = f\"\"\"\n## Iteration 4 — nomination under the landing order (17:35 → 17:55)\n\n**Change.** None to the model. Champion = commit {sha} (v3 code, fold-B parameters fitted on data before\n2026-10-01), served with Latin-hypercube shocks, quantile matching (8x reference) and tick snapping.\n\n**Result (official scorer, 1000 paths, validator prompts scored 2026-10-08 → 2026-11-07, out of sample for\nthe served parameters; starter on the same prompts).**\n\n| config | starter | champion | change | paired vs best / median miner |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CRYPTO_24H | 3785.58 | 3663.19 | -3.23 % | -0.02 % / -0.26 % |\n| COM_EQU_24H | 1988.95 | 1799.38 | -9.53 % | -0.01 % / -0.72 % |\n| CRYPTO_1H | 833.37 | 791.12 | -5.07 % | -0.06 % / -0.33 % |\n\nPer asset (CRPS, paired rank): {per24}; 1h: {per1}.\n\nChecks: nomination probe ok (0.5 s per 24h call, 0.1 s per 1h call); `research/robust.py` passes (constant\ncontext, 3-day and 5-hour contexts, 15 % NaN + 30 stale minutes, rows missing altogether, a 5 % last-minute\njump, bare series, 1/7/100/250 paths, unknown asset, missing or unreadable calendar; an all-NaN context raises).\n\n**Not done (stopped by the landing order at 90 % of credits).** A refit of profile and parameters through\n2026-11-08 was training when the order arrived; I stopped it and serve the validated fold-B parameters\ninstead. The freshness experiment (iteration 3) suggests the refit would help SPCX, SP500, XAU and WTIOIL;\nit is unverified, so it is not in the champion. Also untested: the \"no extras\" and \"v2-like\" ablations, a\nnetwork for the level, volume features, WTIOIL/HYPE post-mortems.\n\n**Verdict.** Nominate. **Lesson.** Plan the credit budget before the first GPU job: long sleeps expire the\nprompt cache and each later turn pays for the whole transcript again.\n\"\"\"\nopen(\"/workspace/agent/journal.md\", \"a\").write(j)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"@@\" agent/report.md; git add agent/CHAMPION agent/report.md agent/journal.md agent/suggestions.md research && git commit -qm \"Final nomination: champion notes with measured CRPS, report, journal\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git log --oneline | head -2; git status --short | head -5; head -3 agent/CHAMPION; sed -n 13,40p agent/BUDGET.md","description":"Stop experiments; finalize CHAMPION, report, journal; commit; read harness check","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":507770,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":985,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5de06de-0f9b-444f-