{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011CgwXqcDh4AYroW2XnEmJi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The landing order is carried out and both checks the stop hook asked for now pass: `git cat-file -t` on the CHAMPION sha prints `commit`, and `git status --short` prints nothing after the last commit (`182cddb`).\n\nTo get a clean work tree I added the harness-owned `agent/BUDGET.md` to `.gitignore`. In the same commit I corrected the time ranges in the journal headers for iterations 2–4, which I had guessed; they are now marked approximate and reconstructed from the harness clock.\n\n## Champion\n\n`agent/CHAMPION` points to commit `6e3fc56c96fde4abf279d4b25acb9c0e3ef4f4a5`. The harness interface check reads \"ok (24h + 1h), CONTEXT_DAYS 30, one call 0.8 s (24h) and 0.2 s (1h)\", and the 31 fitted parameter files are tracked.\n\nOfficial scorer, 1000 paths, validator prompts scored 2026-10-08 → 2026-11-07. The served parameters were fitted on data before 2026-10-01, so this window is out of sample for them.\n\n| Configuration | Starter | Champion | Change | vs best miner | vs median miner |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CRYPTO_24H | 3785.58 | 3663.19 | −3.23 % | −0.02 % | −0.26 % |\n| COM_EQU_24H | 1988.95 | 1799.38 | −9.53 % | −0.01 % | −0.72 % |\n| CRYPTO_1H | 833.37 | 791.12 | −5.07 % | −0.06 % | −0.33 % |\n\nThe last two columns compare mean CRPS with each miner on the prompts both answered.\n\n## What is weak or unverified\n\n- **Thin margins:** the lead over the best miner is a few hundredths of a percent. On the last 12 days alone, against the five miners that turned out best there, the model is 0.2–0.3 % behind on crypto.\n- **WTIOIL and HYPE:** on the 36-day out-of-sample run, WTIOIL ranks 191/231 and loses about 0.5 % to the median miner on ordinary prompts, unexplained. HYPE is mid-field.\n- **Parameters are five weeks older than the cutoff:** a refit through 2026-11-08 was training when the landing order arrived, and I stopped it rather than serve something unvalidated. An earlier comparison suggests it would help SPCX, SP500, XAU and WTIOIL, so further iteration would likely have improved the champion; the credit budget ended it, not the evidence.\n- **Not run:** two of the four component ablations, a learned network for the volatility level, and volume features.\n\nDeliverables are in `agent/`: `CHAMPION`, `report.md`, `journal.md`, `suggestions.md`, with the model in `modeling.py`, `core.py` and `params/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5487,"cache_read_input_tokens":516279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5487,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5de06de-0f9b-444f-a451-a2a51a4613ad","uuid":"f4ec8bef-636c-4304-8fca-c00e921997f7","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:26:33.771Z"}
